# Story 25: Equalize, Swap & Fullscreen (45s)
# Hook: Three quick moves to reset chaos: equalize, swap lanes, and go fullscreen.
# Duration: 45s
# Source: story-025-equalize-swap-fullscreen.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 6

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
Three quick moves to reset chaos: equalize, swap lanes, and go fullscreen.

[00:04.0 --> 00:16.0]
Start rysh, split into columns, then grow one pane wide so we've got an uneven layout to fix.

[00:16.0 --> 00:23.0]
Still in layout mode, press h or equals to equalize all the widths -- instantly balanced columns.

[00:23.0 --> 00:30.0]
Press v to equalize heights the same way for stacked rows.

[00:30.0 --> 00:37.0]
Press s to swap lane positions and reorder your columns.

[00:37.0 --> 00:45.0]
And m fullscreens the active pane -- same as Alt+P f from normal mode. Press it again to restore, Escape to finish.

